I’m treating this as a **real-world engineering audit**, not just a code review.

I'll evaluate the robot from the perspective of an operator who has never seen the project before:

1. Can I map the field and understand where the robot is?
2. Can I start it, navigate crop rows, turn around, and recover from errors?
3. Can I distinguish weeds from crops reliably?
